{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261128/photo/bkn-20261128191246450-1128_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261128215053\"/><p>今晚(28日)攪珠的今年第125期六合彩，攪珠結果為17、18、22、23、35、40，特別號碼13。頭獎1注中，每注派彩99,453,020港元；二獎7.5注中，每注派彩1,063,250港元；三獎343.5注中，每注派61,900港元。</p><p>下期六合彩將於周二(1日)晚上9時30分攪珠，估計頭獎基金為8,000,000港元。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T14:19:46.444507+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":171,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-28T11:12:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T15:34:01.298154+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-28T14:12:59.471744+00:00","content_hash":"e082ed81e407da0f6ee7e8069d2a743a4ef30251bd55f588dcaeed2bff1326cc","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}